## 6. Candidate confirmation

*At the close of each phase, re-read `Maestro/knowledge/candidates.md` from the **upstream
framework's most recent release** (the waiting room; or from the copy, if it is already that
version — confirming does not require syncing:
`Maestro/playbooks/report-framework-improvements.md` step 1) and record here, by **stable ID
(C-nnn)**, each candidate this project **confirmed** (lived the same problem/pattern — with
evidence) or **refuted** (tried it and it did not apply/went wrong — equally valuable). This step
is what gives candidates the 2nd confirmation promotion requires; without it, they depend on
coincidences.*

- **{{C-nnn}} — {{confirmed / refuted}}.** *Evidence:* {{path/commit in the project + 1 line
  of context}}.

